
====================================================================================================
0. spinor-route sanity (independent of the module)
====================================================================================================
max | |<ij>|^2 - 2 p_i.p_j | over random null pairs: 8.88e-16
max |eps.k| (+,-): 2.17e-16 1.49e-16;  eps+.eps- = [1.+0.j 1.+0.j] ; |eps+.conj(eps+)| = [1. 1.]
k along +z: transverse spatial parts (x, y) of eps^+ : [ 1.-0.j -0.-1.j]   of eps^- : [1.+0.j 0.+1.j]
  -> eps^- has (x + i y) form = physical helicity +1 for an INCOMING particle (wavefunction e^{-ikx} eps);
     as the conjugated vector of an OUTGOING particle, eps^- = conj(physical -1)  => label '-' = physical -1 out.
     So: outgoing labels = physical helicities; an incoming graviton of physical helicity +2 fills a '--' slot.

